@baseUrl = http://localhost:5112/api

# =============================================
# AUTH ENDPOINTS
# =============================================

### 1. Register a new Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed@test.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "displayName": "Ahmed Ali",
  "phone": "01012345678"
}

###

### 2. Login (Customer)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed@test.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

###

### 3. Save Token from Login Response
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

# =============================================
# TICKETS ENDPOINTS
# =============================================

### 4. Create a Ticket (Customer)
# categoryId: 1=Hardware, 2=Software, 3=Network
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My laptop is not working",
  "description": "The screen goes black after startup",
  "priority": 1,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### 5. Assign a Ticket to an Agent (SupportLead or Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1,
  "note": "Please handle this urgently"
}

###

### 6. Reassign a Ticket to another Agent (SupportLead or Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/reassign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newAgentId": 2,
  "reassignmentReason": "Original agent is unavailable"
}

###

### 7. Change Ticket Status (Agent or Admin only)
# Status values: 0=New, 1=Open, 2=InProgress, 3=Resolved, 4=Closed, 5=Cancelled
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": 2,
  "reason": "Agent started working on it"
}

###

# =============================================
# COMMENTS ENDPOINTS
# =============================================

### 8. Add a Public Comment on a Ticket (Any logged-in user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/comments/public
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"I checked the issue, it seems to be a hardware problem."

###

### 9. Add an Internal Note on a Ticket (Agent or Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/comments/internal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"Internal note: Customer needs a replacement device."

###

# =============================================
# AGENTS ENDPOINTS
# =============================================

### 10. Get Agent's Ticket Queue (SupportAgent role only)
# Optional query params: ?status=2&slaStatus=1&page=1&pageSize=10
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/me/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# =============================================
# CATEGORIES ENDPOINTS
# =============================================

### 11. Create a Category (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "General Inquiry",
  "description": "General support inquiries"
}

###
